WEBVTT

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.210
You have come to my castle, damned inconsiderates!

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.710
What? What do you want?

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.630
We've stopped attacking you with explosive magic!

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.550
They stopped attacking me?

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.050
What a shameless lie!

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:24.960
No one lies to the demons, carmesíes!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.960
You have attacked my castle every day without fail!

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:28.770
What?

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:39.210
WHAAAAAAT?

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.210
...liberating my magic against empty plains.

00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:46.260
But, since I attacked that castle, if I don't attack something...

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.360
...big and risky, I don't feel satisfied.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.760
Don't say that! This is something serious!

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:55.660
Besides, you end up post-trained after using your magic.

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.860
You need an accomplice to carry you.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:58.480
Huh?

00:00:58.480 --> 00:00:59.420
Ah.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.000
Shh, shh, shh.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.490
Nyeh, shh...

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:12.900
Listen,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:13.860
you fools!

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:15.580
My name is Verdea!

00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:18.730
That's not the only reason why I'm offended,

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:19.950
VERY offended!

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:24.100
You didn't even have the guts to avenge the death of your partner!

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:26.070
Because now I'm evil,

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:27.970
I aspired to be a noble knight in life.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:30.000
In my opinion, letting that

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:33.510
An exemplary paladin would die protecting his companions!

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.060
It's something simply unforgivable!

00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:37.060
You have it in honor!

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:38.330
Huh?

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:43.840
So...

00:01:44.190 --> 00:01:44.890
You said...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.290
"Exemplary paladin"?

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:48.680
What?

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:49.840
Huh?

00:01:53.660 --> 00:01:55.360
♪ Kintomita Sekai ♪

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:57.810
♪ Hashin ♪

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.710
Did you know that you said the curse as soon as he left?

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:39.410
How funny! How funny! It's so funny!

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:44.710
I would annihilate all the inhabitants of the city if I wanted to, don't make me angry!

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.480
What a dead man!

00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:50.010
Your adventurer's magic is no good, it is not...

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:51.350
Expelling the dead!

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.710
Oh, hey Kazuma! That didn't work!

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.670
Well, I thought it was very effective.

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.250
Even the scream!

00:04:08.250 --> 00:04:11.360
Really?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:13.540
You're a newbie!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:17.630
Isn't it supposed to be a city of beginners?

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.470
Meh, it doesn't matter.

00:04:20.470 --> 00:04:23.430
It's not necessary to face them in person.

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:29.920
Undead gentlemen, show them what hell is like!

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:34.950
I bet you're surprised because you didn't expect your magic to work.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:39.730
That's right! I let you jump directly into the battle!

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:41.230
In front of my whispers!

00:04:41.230 --> 00:04:42.930
Listen, you're not dead, you're...

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.220
My... my eyes! My eyes!

00:04:51.220 --> 00:04:55.960
You're welcome.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.970
Judging by the scream, I'd say it worked very well.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.520
That's enough!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.340
Kill everyone!

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:10.700
Kill everyone in the city!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:16.400
The priest! Go!

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:20.890
Now I want to hear your cries of despair!

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:42.640
Maybe the undead are looking for divine salvation by instinct.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:51.280
Megumin, could you defeat the undead with your magic?

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.010
TOO MUCH!

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.950
Just a moment...

00:06:15.950 --> 00:06:21.440
I'm here to conquer your spell!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.650
FOLLOW ME!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:47.660
I control the magic of demons and I control the explosive magic

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.670
Look at my power!

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:13.440
They were very astonished after having witnessed my explosive magic.

00:07:15.840 --> 00:07:19.050
It feels... so good.

00:07:20.490 --> 00:07:22.280
Do you need me to carry you?

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.430
Yes, please.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:30.000
She did it! The demon carmesí madly

00:07:30.030 --> 00:07:30.910
She got it!

00:07:30.910 --> 00:07:34.670
Even if she's crazy and her name is strange, you can trust her!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.110
Now I see you in a different way, crazy girl!

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:39.450
Hey, Suma...

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.520
Could you please remember her face?

00:07:42.520 --> 00:07:44.390
You know how to taint them...

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.670
How interesting...

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:55.420
How interesting! How interesting!

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:58.860
I never imagined they would end my whispers so easily...

00:07:58.860 --> 00:07:59.760
Very well...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.600
As promised!

00:08:01.600 --> 00:08:03.400
Kazuma!

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:07.840
Then I will face them! Even if I have to do it myself!

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:10.770
Megumin ran out of his magic

00:08:10.770 --> 00:08:13.220
And Aqua can't annihilate him with yours

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.370
What will we do?

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:15.790
Don't worry!

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.340
The Ace of the City will arrive soon!

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:21.960
Yes, it doesn't matter that he is one of the leaders of the Demon King!

00:08:21.960 --> 00:08:24.000
The Ace of the City?

00:08:24.000 --> 00:08:27.020
We will create a blind spot attacking together!

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.090
Come on, guys!

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:34.100
It seems that you want to die first.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.510
STOP!

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.980
DON'T GO!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:05.470
Who is the next one?

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:06.370
You will see!

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.330
Mitsurugi will defeat him in one blow when he arrives!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:11.650
Mitsurugi?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:16.420
Mitsurugi is...

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:20.420
The adventurer to whom I stole his sword and then sold it.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:21.420
Who?

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:28.800
While we wait!

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.110
They will not resist until then!

00:09:34.110 --> 00:09:45.050
Treves! How could you do that to them?

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:48.400
No, Darkness! You will not win with your sword!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.330
Like the defender of the weak that I am, there are things that I can not allow you!

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:59.770
What do you think? Use me as an example and all that?

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:04.810
to the public indecently, with your thorns and large arms!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.720
Try it if you can!

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.440
I love that you are capable!

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.100
Enough of hallucinations! You make me look bad!

00:10:13.100 --> 00:10:17.280
Face me now!

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:21.180
Today I had to face a sacred paradise!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:43.200
Unbelievable! She couldn't attack an immobile target, what a shame! And the worst thing is that she's my ally!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.040
What a disappointment...

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:47.960
I'll kill you!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:09.280
The paladins! We can't give up when we have to protect someone. It's an unbreakable rule!

00:11:09.280 --> 00:11:16.610
Besides, Dullahead is as ruined as I thought it would be.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:17.610
What does it say?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:24.560
It has been destroying my armor little by little, instead of undressing me completely.

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:30.000
It stops halfway and leaves certain parts of my armor intact.

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.910
so you can get an even more erotic result!

00:11:34.410 --> 00:11:36.140
Go ahead!

00:11:36.140 --> 00:11:38.730
Is this how you humiliate the Demon King's army?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:41.180
Keep attacking me! Do it!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.950
Everything has its moment and its place, you damn pervert!

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.190
Pervert?

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.390
No, the same! I could say the same about you, Kazuma!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:58.400
Being hit in public by a monster demands everything from me!

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.000
But tell me Kazuma!

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:06.980
I DON'T TRY ANYTHING!

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.070
No!

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:09.570
But if...

00:12:09.570 --> 00:12:11.490
You got enough time.

00:12:11.490 --> 00:12:11.990
MMMF!

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:14.130
WATER!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:22.960
It's just that I hate to receive...

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:24.420
This kind of treatment.

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:26.860
But everything has its moment and place.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.870
You're wrong! It's not a type of pregame!

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:30.000
You planned it!

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.000
I'm gonna do this!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.990
FREEZE!

00:12:31.990 --> 00:12:34.200
He got me!

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.380
Difficulty in movement is enough.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:39.300
This is my true objective.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.290
It was not a bad trick.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.240
The difference in level is evident.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.180
10

00:12:53.180 --> 00:12:55.230
I will end this farce.

00:12:59.020 --> 00:12:59.440
Kazuma!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:11.210
And try to remember, we face a Dullahan

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:14.240
What would be his weakness in an RPG?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.640
Analyze it well, how could he

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.940
avoid water with so much dexterity?

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:23.910
His weak point is, the weakness of the undead is

00:13:30.030 --> 00:13:40.060
I'm grateful to the demon king and the false gods for allowing me to face you, say goodbye to you, for being so heroic as Nessia!

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.040
What are you trying to do, moron?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:49.220
Use water!

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.950
I'll create it!

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:54.190
Enough! Stop attacking me!

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:11.240
Hey, now what happens? What are they playing? Tell me. How stupid are you?

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:18.410
Hey, you are a ... He is weak to water. Can't you use some water spell, goddess attempt?

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:23.490
It's time for you to put yourself in your gross place. I can cause floods with my magic.

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:24.500
Really?

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:30.000
Excuse yourself! Excuse yourself for having called "goddess attempt" to a goddess!

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:35.030
I'll apologize as much as you want, but hurry up, useless goddess!

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:38.350
You called me useless goddess again!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:43.700
You'll see, Kazuma. I'll show you my goddess traits.

00:14:43.700 --> 00:14:46.850
I call all my faithful in this world.

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:50.060
This is Aqua, the goddess of water.

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.610
What are you doing?

00:14:52.610 --> 00:14:55.850
Answer my request, my prayers.

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:57.850
Show the world your power!

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.000
Damn it!

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.030
*gasp*

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:02.430
F*ck me!

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:03.990
F*ck the undeprived!

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:08.320
You are abusive...

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:19.750
ENOUGH!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:44.410
How dare you that you do not know how to think?

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:50.610
I swear I'm going to take your weapon off you.

00:15:50.610 --> 00:16:00.000
It may be weakened, but a novice could never take control of my weapon using stealing!

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:19.830
with this!

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.830
Hey, friends!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:25.830
What do you think

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.830
if we play football?

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:30.000
-Football? -This is football!

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:32.520
With your feet, without your hands!

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:33.940
Only with your feet?

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:36.200
Hey, no! Hey, leave me alone!

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:40.860
Alto, help! Help! Alto! Alto, he hurt me! Alto, here, here!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:43.470
You are already weak enough.

00:16:43.470 --> 00:16:45.900
You can hit him with the grace.

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.320
You're right.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.400
Aqua!

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.070
I can take care of it!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:50.870
Do it.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.480
"What are you doing?"

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:59.510
"I'm praying for the others. I pray for Cedol, the liar who said I looked muscular with my armor on. And also for Haines, who bothered me by saying, 'Attack me with your sword. Try to hit me if you want, but I doubt you can.' And Garich, who let me be part of his group, even if it was only for one day, and scolded me for running towards a group of monsters."

00:18:00.540 --> 00:18:09.860
They were all killed by Dullahan. If we could see each other again, I would love to drink with them.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:18.870
Tell me, do you have to be so bad with the sword?

00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:23.450
Well, I'm sorry. I'll invite you a drink.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:26.810
Oh, they were... alive.

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:30.000
For someone who...

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.000
And like me, reviving fallen adventurers is very simple!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:38.050
You can enjoy that drink together!

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:41.190
It seems that Darkness has a lot to solve, right?

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:42.100
Shh, they heard you.

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.490
I'm going to die.

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.290
Calm down.

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:49.840
Let's remember what you did for at least three days.

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:51.970
It's not fair.

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:56.310
This is not the kind of abuse I like to receive!

00:18:56.310 --> 00:18:58.730
*crying*

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:10.090
We fixed them this time.

00:19:10.940 --> 00:19:14.400
I think I prefer to lead a quiet life, and without prejudices.

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:18.520
I'm waiting, Kazuma! Listen to me!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.670
Darkness' bitch says that I can't drink yet!

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:24.280
Let's see, that's not what I meant to say...

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:27.020
Kazuma, it's late!

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.000
It's over, Eve!

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:33.940
Oh Kasuma! I was waiting for you!

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:38.110
To be honest, I have a very special reward for your group.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.090
Oh, really?

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:44.780
Thank you, but why only for us?

00:19:44.780 --> 00:19:47.730
Who would have thought that they would defeat him?

00:19:47.730 --> 00:19:51.730
I believed in your inner fervor from the moment you arrived at this place.

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:53.880
In my inner fervor?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:57.370
A light that illuminates the gates of hell.

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:00.000
There may be legends about it.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:04.860
Exactly! If it weren't for you, we would never have defeated Dullahan!

00:20:04.860 --> 00:20:09.950
Kazuma!

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:15.420
I'm not used to this, but it's not bad.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.990
Ahem!

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:20.850
To recognize the great feat of your group, the prize...

00:20:20.850 --> 00:20:23.320
...is 300 MILLION EX!

00:20:23.320 --> 00:20:25.690
300 MILLION?!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:27.390
Invite me to eat, Kazuma!

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:30.000
Kazuma, invite me, invite me!

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.270
I have something important to tell you.

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:35.280
Since we won thanks to me, I have 90%.

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:40.280
Now that we won this fortune, I will live in a relaxed and very safe way.

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:41.280
But Kazuma...

00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:42.240
Let me finish.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:44.240
It would be terrible if I could not face strong enemies.

00:20:44.240 --> 00:20:45.240
I would not.

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.240
I also oppose.

00:20:46.240 --> 00:20:51.060
We will defeat the demon king together and finally win the title that will make me a supreme mage.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.060
You will not.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.060
Will you be a Nini-Hikikomori again?

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.060
No, because I'm not a Nini-Hikikomori.

00:20:56.060 --> 00:20:57.060
I can not come back here.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.310
I have already decided.

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:00.000
What?

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:03.620
- Don't talk to me like that, you useless god! - Excuse me, what a useless sum!

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:06.310
It's a check, it's a check, right?

00:21:06.310 --> 00:21:16.130
Actually, the flood that was invoked by Aqua left the outside walls in a very bad state.

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:21.840
But, since they defeated a leader of the Demon King's army, we don't expect them to pay the full sum.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:23.840
I just ask you to pay a part.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:25.840
- I'm going to... - Wait.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:27.940
The reward.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:30.000
It's 300 million, but the debt...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:36.630
-The debt is 340. -Our long and bloody magical journey has just begun!

00:21:36.630 --> 00:21:44.350
-And if we do a profitable mission with strong enemies? -Can we split the debt in equal parts?

00:21:44.350 --> 00:21:50.230
-Am I going to spend the rest of my life in an absurd world with these useless allies?

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:54.250
-After thinking about it carefully, I have decided to kill the demon king.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:59.470
-Everything is to escape from this world full of useless.

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.000
They venerated her from the bottom of their heart.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.400
and the children were ecstatic when they saw her.

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:38.060
She was awaited by an avalanche of admirers in the "Poletos Numerados",

00:23:38.060 --> 00:23:39.860
a prologue written by the great magician.
